      "message": "the existing android_vh_filemap_add_folio and trace_mm_filemap_add_to_page_cache are triggered for all page cache additions and don\u0027t provide context about whether the page came from readahead. We need to identify readahead pages at allocation time so we can apply different memory management policies (e.g., more aggressive reclaim) to speculative pages that may never be accessed.",
